<section id="Sx3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Reproducibility statement</h2>

<div id="Sx3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For reproducing the systematic analysis:
Section <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Systematic Analysis of Visual Representations ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> introduces the overall setup, research questions, and analysis procedure. Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Details of Representation Sensitivity Analysis ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>
further specifies the extraction and preprocessing of understanding- and
generation-side representations across UMMs, together with the computation of the sensitivity, resolution, and spatial-dependence analyses.</p>
</div>
<div id="Sx3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For reproducing GAFU training and evaluation:
Section <a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2 Generation-Assisted Understanding Framework ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a> describes the overall GAFU architecture
and the basic procedures of Stage 1 and Stage 2, while
Section <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Experimental Setup ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a> summarizes the tasks, models, and
overall experimental setup. Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Compression and Alignment ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> specifies
the Stage 1 GToken Encoder–Decoder architecture and the computation of the
reconstruction, spatial-binding, and relation-alignment objectives.
Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Task-Conditioned Injection and Fine-Tuning ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> describes the Stage 2 injection
modules, training objectives, gradient decomposition, masking schedule, and shuffle-donor construction. Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Experimental Details ‣ What Generation Knows: Unlocking Fine-Grained Understanding in Unified Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>
provides the data composition, preprocessing examples, optimizer and training
configurations, and evaluation protocols.</p>
</div>
