<span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">Question:</span><span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"> What is shown in this close-up view of the cut surface of the apparently non-functional tissue?</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:387.6pt;">
<span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">Answer:</span><span id="A4.F7.2.1.3.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"> Fixed tissue.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span>
